{%- comment -%}
  Line icons for the dropshipping page (sections/alc-dropship.liquid), one 24px grid,
  1.6 stroke. WhatsApp is the brand glyph, filled.

  Accepts:
  - name: {String} whatsapp | list | card | truck | wallet | box | spark | globe | cog | people
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- case name -%}
  {%- when 'whatsapp' -%}
